# v0.1 reproducible SensSmartTech baseline archive
# Keep only the explicitly named checkpoint and evaluation artifacts; raw data,
# all other runs, and unrelated experiment weights remain ignored.
!checkpoints/
!checkpoints/SensSmartTech_subjectwise-per-lead_baseline_seed42_20ep/
!checkpoints/SensSmartTech_subjectwise-per-lead_baseline_seed42_20ep/*.pth
!checkpoints/SensSmartTech_subjectwise-per-lead_baseline_seed42_20ep/*.json
!checkpoints/SensSmartTech_subjectwise-per-lead_baseline_seed42_20ep/*.yaml
!checkpoints/SensSmartTech_subjectwise-per-lead_baseline_seed42_20ep/*.log
